---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Request received" description="Your installer quote request was received." noindex>
  <section class="container" style="padding-block: var(--space-3xl); max-width: 900px;">
    <h1>Got it. Your request is in.</h1>
    <p class="standfirst" style="margin-top: var(--space-lg);">We will match you with one licensed installer who serves your ZIP code, usually within one business day. If nobody covers your area yet, we will email you to say so.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-lg);">While you wait, read <a href="/how-much-does-a-whole-house-generator-cost/">what a whole-house generator really costs</a> or <a href="/generator-transfer-switch-cost/">what a transfer switch costs</a>, so you can judge the quote when it arrives.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
